- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/PRD.md`, and `docs/TASKS.md` before large changes.
- Safety rules in AGENTS.md override convenience. If a request conflicts, stop and ask.
- Never fabricate drug names, prices, strengths, uses, or Kendra locations in app code or data.
- Synthetic test data lives only in `backend/tests/fixtures/` and must be clearly fake.
